ividual developer or an AI development tool.","Access type","unavailable","access","section","Platform listing is not game source — Browser-delivered files are not automatically the complete maintainable project; verify creator-provided source separately.","service","demo",[76],{"_57":77,"_25":78,"_79":80},"Browse games on CrazyGames","https://www.crazygames.com/","note","Browser-game portal. Individual titles have their own input, device, and network requirements.","tutorial",[83],{"_57":84,"_25":85,"_79":86},"CrazyGames publishing documentation","https://docs.crazygames.com/","Official requirements, SDK guides, testing tools, and launch workflow for web games.","Source reviewed","2026-10-20","verified","metadata","list","Tracks","ordered",false,[97,98],"dimensions","2D","3D","Development stages",[102],"stages","Build & release","Topics",[106,107,108],"tags","Publishing","Game discovery","Browser games","Further reading",[111,112,113],{"_57":77,"_25":78},{"_57":84,"_25":85},{"_57":114,"_25":115},"CrazyGames submission requirements","https://docs.crazygames.com/requirements/intro/","Project source",[118],{"_57":116,"_25":62},"Why it belongs here","CrazyGames hosts browser games, with a separate developer portal and documentation for submission, technical requirements, SDK integration, and testing. Submissions receive QA review; Basic Launch and Full Launch have different requirements and availability. Supported web technologies span multiple engines. A playable portal build is a distribution artifact, not evidence that the complete game project is public or that AI developed it.","detail","guidance","Resource type","Community","Category","Game production","category","lead","summary","name","production","community",[146,147,148],{"_81":141,"_74":142,"_32":143},[106,107,108],[140],[138,139],"2d","3d","ship",{"_57":84,"_25":85,"_17":81,"_79":86},{"_57":77,"_25":78,"_17":73,"_79":80},{"_57":144,"_17":69,"_79":145},"Platform listing is not game source","Browser-delivered